  abstract: |
    As AI gets smarter, it does not reliably get safer, and the methods used to measure safety are themselves unreliable. This executive summary is the map of the whole programme: thirty-one documents in the public register, twenty-nine of them papers by the site's own counting rule, the ARC Theory's five laws carried as named conjectures (Laws IV and V, added on 24 September 2026, are neither registered as laws nor tested, and their mathematics is set out at version 1.0 of 3 October 2026), the Eden Protocol intervention, the field of Recursive Dynamics that the author founded, the theory-level registration that fixed twenty-two severable propositions before any of them could be scored, and a study estate whose deciding instruments are written and dated, their schedules regenerable by any reader from a published seed: one unit, the corrector-class audit, was submitted for registration on OSF on 1 October 2026 and was not yet public when read on 3 October 2026, and every other is a draft awaiting the author's submission, preregistered by timestamp where a receipt exists. Every claim is graded in the public registers; nothing here is confirmed, and the deciding tests are written down before they are run.

